<item><title>Nouakchott hosts second Saudi Quran and Sunna memorisation contest for West Africa</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mr/nouakchott-hosts-second-saudi-quran-and-sunna-memorisation-dd5823/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mr/nouakchott-hosts-second-saudi-quran-and-sunna-memorisation-dd5823/</guid><category>Mauritania</category><description>The contest brings 160 participants from 16 West African countries to compete in two sections, one on memorising the Quran and one on the Sunna.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 15:13:36 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mr.jpg" length="34560" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mr.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Artisanal gold miners report cross-border shelling near Sahara sand wall</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mr/artisanal-gold-miners-report-cross-border-shelling-near-20487e/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mr/artisanal-gold-miners-report-cross-border-shelling-near-20487e/</guid><category>Mauritania</category><description>Artisanal gold miners in a buffer zone near the Sahara sand wall reported hearing artillery and rocket fire from both sides of the border on Sunday night.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 13:41:56 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mr/artisanal-gold-miners-report-cross-border-shelling-near-20487e/share.jpg" length="45607" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mr/artisanal-gold-miners-report-cross-border-shelling-near-20487e/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
